1
00:00:02,721 --> 00:00:05,083
(Episode 7)

2
00:00:51,738 --> 00:00:56,782
I'm not sure if he's a good person or not.

3
00:01:00,290 --> 00:01:02,437
But he likes me a lot.

4
00:01:04,771 --> 00:01:08,797
I haven't had anyone
who liked me for a long time,

5
00:01:12,074 --> 00:01:13,974
besides you.

6
00:01:19,842 --> 00:01:24,407
You and Yu Mi look great together.

7
00:01:27,043 --> 00:01:31,565
So I want to be happy like you are.

8
00:01:35,242 --> 00:01:37,182
Will you be happy for me?

9
00:02:07,034 --> 00:02:11,314
I'll appreciate it
if you support Director Han.

10
00:02:11,314 --> 00:02:15,055
He is still young,
and has a lot to learn on the job.

11
00:02:15,603 --> 00:02:17,672
- By the way.
- What is it?

12
00:02:17,672 --> 00:02:19,586
Why is the food always bad?

13
00:02:21,608 --> 00:02:22,829
Do you really think it's tasty?

14
00:02:27,313 --> 00:02:29,556
He's the youngest son...

15
00:02:29,556 --> 00:02:32,188
All right now, can we start?

16
00:02:33,264 --> 00:02:36,583
They say reservations for public courses
have decreased.

17
00:02:36,583 --> 00:02:38,650
Speaking of which...

18
00:02:38,650 --> 00:02:41,524
What? Are you not satisfied with
the desserts, either?

19
00:02:42,689 --> 00:02:45,162
The public courses
have more female members.

20
00:02:45,162 --> 00:02:48,587
So, how about we offer exclusive benefits
for female members?

21
00:02:49,609 --> 00:02:51,385
Such as giving priority to them...

22
00:02:51,385 --> 00:02:53,644
and arranging teams
based on their levels and ages.

23
00:02:54,224 --> 00:02:56,213
Since men often go golfing for business,

24
00:02:56,213 --> 00:02:57,880
they don't have much trouble
having their teams.

25
00:02:57,880 --> 00:03:01,736
But I think it is probably a challenge
to make teams for housewives.

26
00:03:11,221 --> 00:03:13,542
I briefly pointed out problems
with our course menu.

27
00:03:13,542 --> 00:03:14,542
Especially,

28
00:03:17,055 --> 00:03:18,817
about this unpleasant main dish.

29
00:03:19,767 --> 00:03:21,849
Many complaints are saying
our menu selection is not good enough.

30
00:03:21,849 --> 00:03:24,641
I believe it is a big issue at a golf club
where people invite their guests.

31
00:03:24,641 --> 00:03:27,163
Please look at the first page.

32
00:03:30,552 --> 00:03:31,552
What?

33
00:03:31,552 --> 00:03:34,258
You did a good job. What happened?

34
00:03:34,258 --> 00:03:35,969
I need to do things properly...

35
00:03:38,492 --> 00:03:40,670
to support my family.

36
00:03:46,467 --> 00:03:47,485
Aren't you getting on?

37
00:03:49,106 --> 00:03:50,325
See you later.

38
00:03:51,691 --> 00:03:52,812
What did you mean?

39
00:03:54,147 --> 00:03:55,462
What was that about?

40
00:03:58,259 --> 00:04:00,740
Is it Eun Seo? Is it?

41
00:04:01,897 --> 00:04:03,075
See you later.

42
00:04:07,155 --> 00:04:09,092
Okay, all right.

43
00:04:09,092 --> 00:04:10,944
I'm coming today.

44
00:04:11,901 --> 00:04:12,901
Eun Seo?

45
00:04:13,637 --> 00:04:15,040
Of course.

46
00:04:16,124 --> 00:04:17,387
Yes.

47
00:04:17,387 --> 00:04:19,463
See you later, then.

48
00:04:54,019 --> 00:04:55,597
Stop laughing at me.

49
00:04:56,259 --> 00:04:57,318
Wait and see.

50
00:05:14,814 --> 00:05:15,960
Can you get the ball for me?

51
00:05:18,447 --> 00:05:19,465
That one.

52
00:06:01,626 --> 00:06:05,981
This is expensive, isn't it?

53
00:06:06,367 --> 00:06:11,020
My mom told me one day.

54
00:06:11,769 --> 00:06:13,962
Gifts shouldn't be judged by their value.

55
00:06:15,481 --> 00:06:16,489
Give me that.

56
00:06:19,447 --> 00:06:20,672
I'll put it on you.

57
00:06:33,679 --> 00:06:34,937
I'll be good.

58
00:06:35,863 --> 00:06:38,876
I'll be good to you. I will try.

59
00:06:40,811 --> 00:06:44,459
I'll be the man you wish for.

60
00:06:46,844 --> 00:06:48,693
I even attended the meeting today.

61
00:06:50,362 --> 00:06:51,637
I did a great job.

62
00:06:55,953 --> 00:06:57,156
I am sorry.

63
00:06:58,137 --> 00:06:59,916
I can't take this.

64
00:07:00,923 --> 00:07:04,243
I have nothing for you,
so I shouldn't take this.

65
00:07:09,738 --> 00:07:10,799
I know that.

66
00:07:12,514 --> 00:07:14,514
I'll take care of everything.

67
00:07:14,514 --> 00:07:15,955
You just stay.

68
00:07:17,505 --> 00:07:23,168
You just breathe, smile, and...

69
00:07:23,168 --> 00:07:26,652
just stay by my side.

70
00:07:29,431 --> 00:07:30,431
Will you?

71
00:07:33,256 --> 00:07:34,256
Yes?

72
00:07:58,431 --> 00:07:59,771
How have you been?

73
00:08:02,806 --> 00:08:04,353
Do you think I would've been good?

74
00:08:08,261 --> 00:08:11,232
I don't want your apology.

75
00:08:15,334 --> 00:08:17,945
Have you lost trust in me that much?

76
00:08:19,020 --> 00:08:20,211
Yes, I have.

77
00:08:22,496 --> 00:08:26,194
If you're sorry,
would you go somewhere with me?

78
00:08:31,384 --> 00:08:32,475
Come on in.

79
00:08:35,392 --> 00:08:36,682
Would you like a coffee?

80
00:08:49,488 --> 00:08:51,155
This is my apartment.

81
00:08:58,193 --> 00:09:01,359
I moved a few days ago.

82
00:09:01,359 --> 00:09:04,882
I didn't get the best one,
since I was in a rush.

83
00:09:06,250 --> 00:09:08,497
It is a fine place, isn't it?

84
00:09:08,497 --> 00:09:12,042
It's close to your studio and school.

85
00:09:13,392 --> 00:09:14,392
Yu Mi.

86
00:09:15,510 --> 00:09:17,559
I know what you want to say.

87
00:09:19,684 --> 00:09:22,003
I know you don't love me,

88
00:09:23,979 --> 00:09:25,899
and you've never loved me.

89
00:09:28,207 --> 00:09:31,216
So, as you said,

90
00:09:31,216 --> 00:09:34,140
it would be better for me
to break up with you.

91
00:09:35,825 --> 00:09:38,836
I'm not a fool. I know everything.

92
00:09:40,056 --> 00:09:42,147
I have something I haven't told you.

93
00:09:49,321 --> 00:09:52,314
I like someone else.

94
00:10:00,009 --> 00:10:03,888
I even know why you are...

95
00:10:03,888 --> 00:10:05,258
so cruel to me.

96
00:10:06,304 --> 00:10:08,387
You're trying to make me give up on you.

97
00:10:09,849 --> 00:10:14,795
But, I have no intention to leave you.

98
00:10:16,912 --> 00:10:20,512
Even if you love someone else,

99
00:10:20,512 --> 00:10:22,834
I don't want to let you go.

100
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:39,041
Does the person, whom you like,
like you back?

101
00:10:44,359 --> 00:10:46,005
If I let you go,

102
00:10:47,537 --> 00:10:50,021
can you marry her?

103
00:10:51,929 --> 00:10:53,453
Is there any chance for that?

104
00:10:57,651 --> 00:10:59,950
Yu Mi, she...

105
00:11:06,410 --> 00:11:08,285
It's probably Tae Seok and Eun Seo.

106
00:11:09,002 --> 00:11:11,728
I invited them for dinner.

107
00:11:14,175 --> 00:11:17,735
They are seeing each other now.

108
00:11:17,735 --> 00:11:18,802
You don't know that, do you?

109
00:11:26,067 --> 00:11:27,436
It looks great.

110
00:11:27,436 --> 00:11:28,860
When did you do all of this?

111
00:11:28,860 --> 00:11:30,348
It's been about a week.

112
00:11:30,348 --> 00:11:32,089
It must've been a lot of work.

113
00:11:32,089 --> 00:11:34,801
Congratulations on your new home.

114
00:11:34,801 --> 00:11:35,821
Thanks.

115
00:11:36,985 --> 00:11:38,764
Do you like it here, Eun Seo?

116
00:11:41,713 --> 00:11:43,530
It is a pretty apartment.

117
00:11:44,146 --> 00:11:45,346
Have a seat.

118
00:11:45,346 --> 00:11:47,403
The dinner will be ready soon.

119
00:11:52,855 --> 00:11:55,322
It's not a lot, but help yourself.

120
00:11:56,078 --> 00:11:57,746
There is a lot of food.

121
00:11:59,303 --> 00:12:01,673
Do you want to try this?
Do you know how to eat?

122
00:12:02,975 --> 00:12:04,041
I'm fine.

123
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:07,109
Try it.

124
00:12:11,052 --> 00:12:13,150
Do you like it?

125
00:12:13,150 --> 00:12:15,377
Jun Seo, did she eat well like this
as a child?

126
00:12:16,717 --> 00:12:17,717
She did.

127
00:12:19,174 --> 00:12:20,887
I think she was adorable.

128
00:12:22,533 --> 00:12:25,544
Jun Seo, I'm jealous of you.
You saw her so much when she was little.

129
00:12:26,908 --> 00:12:30,725
Since you grew up together,

130
00:12:30,725 --> 00:12:32,536
you two are like real siblings, I believe.

131
00:12:36,541 --> 00:12:39,353
You probably feel like she is your sister
more than Sin Ae is.

132
00:12:46,757 --> 00:12:47,937
I like that.

133
00:12:48,957 --> 00:12:51,338
Do you mean this one?

134
00:12:51,338 --> 00:12:53,725
It is pretty, isn't it?
I found it for her.

135
00:12:54,331 --> 00:12:57,158
Did you find it? I see.

136
00:12:57,852 --> 00:13:00,076
I wanted to give her a ring,

137
00:13:01,514 --> 00:13:02,770
but I think it's too early.

138
00:13:05,207 --> 00:13:06,994
Check out mine, first.

139
00:13:06,994 --> 00:13:09,652
Then, you get her a better one
than my ring, Tae Seok.

140
00:13:09,652 --> 00:13:12,084
Is this your engagement ring?

141
00:13:12,938 --> 00:13:14,006
Do you like it?

142
00:13:15,513 --> 00:13:19,909
Yes, it is beautiful.

143
00:13:21,050 --> 00:13:23,666
Jun Seo, you have good taste.

144
00:13:23,666 --> 00:13:28,206
Jun Seo, you should choose our ring later.

145
00:13:28,206 --> 00:13:29,798
I'll get you more soup.

146
00:13:29,798 --> 00:13:30,947
It's hot!

147
00:13:31,662 --> 00:13:34,238
Are you all right? Did you burn yourself?

148
00:13:34,238 --> 00:13:35,238
No.

149
00:13:44,909 --> 00:13:48,279
Did you make up with Jun Seo?

150
00:13:52,084 --> 00:13:55,048
He is stubborn.

151
00:13:57,133 --> 00:14:00,071
He will be better soon.

152
00:14:02,307 --> 00:14:04,504
Are you happy, Eun Seo?

153
00:14:06,005 --> 00:14:10,369
Tae Seok is a good guy
if you get to know him better.

154
00:14:11,213 --> 00:14:13,072
I know.

155
00:14:15,597 --> 00:14:19,312
I bet you were so adorable
when you were little.

156
00:14:21,125 --> 00:14:22,536
I don't remember that much.

157
00:14:23,852 --> 00:14:26,368
Do you remember about Jun Seo?

158
00:14:27,781 --> 00:14:28,906
Yes.

159
00:14:30,172 --> 00:14:33,135
Of course, I remember him.

160
00:14:48,707 --> 00:14:49,797
She was pretty.

161
00:14:52,973 --> 00:14:54,261
She was really pretty.

162
00:14:54,770 --> 00:14:56,786
How lucky you are.

163
00:14:56,786 --> 00:14:58,406
You have so many memories with Eun Seo.

164
00:14:59,603 --> 00:15:02,734
I'm envious of you for the first time.

165
00:15:06,906 --> 00:15:10,060
I officially ask your permission.

166
00:15:11,795 --> 00:15:13,563
Please allow me.

167
00:15:13,563 --> 00:15:15,205
I'll make your cousin happy.

168
00:15:21,381 --> 00:15:22,412
Jun Seo.

169
00:15:26,226 --> 00:15:30,769
Tae Seok, I have something to tell you...

170
00:15:31,326 --> 00:15:33,741
I'm asking you, too.

171
00:15:33,741 --> 00:15:35,393
Please make Eun Seo happy.

172
00:15:37,086 --> 00:15:38,274
Do you allow me on behalf of Jun Seo?

173
00:15:39,590 --> 00:15:42,779
Since you two will get married soon?

174
00:16:19,118 --> 00:16:20,241
Eun Seo.

175
00:16:22,687 --> 00:16:24,704
We should stop lying.

176
00:16:28,072 --> 00:16:30,042
I don't want to lie anymore.

177
00:16:35,503 --> 00:16:40,301
If we're not honest now,
we will all be miserable.

178
00:16:40,301 --> 00:16:42,089
It'll be much harder later on.

179
00:16:44,246 --> 00:16:49,513
Tae Seok, you, me, and Yu Mi,

180
00:16:52,246 --> 00:16:53,296
all of us.

181
00:17:00,887 --> 00:17:02,313
You're not in love with him.

182
00:17:06,071 --> 00:17:09,451
Do you really love Tae Seok?

183
00:17:13,744 --> 00:17:15,626
You don't, Eun Seo.

184
00:17:36,585 --> 00:17:38,252
I think this is it.

185
00:17:40,065 --> 00:17:42,941
We should've called them before we came.

186
00:17:45,827 --> 00:17:47,101
Dad.

187
00:18:05,334 --> 00:18:06,600
Mom?

188
00:18:10,620 --> 00:18:12,390
Eun Seo?

189
00:18:15,821 --> 00:18:17,006
Eun Seo.

190
00:18:20,374 --> 00:18:21,633
Eun Seo.

191
00:18:27,061 --> 00:18:28,410
Eun Seo.

192
00:18:28,410 --> 00:18:30,949
Eun Seo.

193
00:18:31,922 --> 00:18:34,856
Let me look at you.

194
00:18:34,856 --> 00:18:36,953
- Are you Eun Seo?
- Yes, mom.

195
00:18:36,953 --> 00:18:38,754
- Eun Seo?
- Mom.

196
00:18:40,239 --> 00:18:41,346
Eun Seo.

197
00:18:41,832 --> 00:18:44,274
- Mom.
- Eun Seo.

198
00:18:47,801 --> 00:18:51,020
Are you Eun Seo? Eun Seo?

199
00:18:58,761 --> 00:19:04,126
Eun Seo, you have grown up.

200
00:19:06,130 --> 00:19:07,204
Mom.

201
00:19:11,954 --> 00:19:13,892
You have grown up so much.

202
00:19:20,466 --> 00:19:22,443
While you have grown up this much,

203
00:19:24,063 --> 00:19:26,970
I haven't done anything for you.

204
00:19:31,199 --> 00:19:32,737
Hasn't it been hard, Eun Seo?

205
00:19:35,207 --> 00:19:36,811
No, it hasn't.

206
00:19:37,738 --> 00:19:39,211
How were you at school?

207
00:19:39,848 --> 00:19:40,848
I was fine.

208
00:19:43,071 --> 00:19:46,883
But I wasn't a great student.

209
00:19:48,384 --> 00:19:49,868
Mom, I'm sorry.

210
00:19:52,384 --> 00:19:54,437
You know I didn't like studying.

211
00:19:57,185 --> 00:19:58,995
Eun Seo, what should I do?

212
00:20:01,529 --> 00:20:04,514
I'm so sorry, Eun Seo.

213
00:20:05,447 --> 00:20:07,714
I left you alone,

214
00:20:09,337 --> 00:20:11,524
I left you behind...

215
00:20:11,524 --> 00:20:14,143
It's okay, Mom. I'm fine.

216
00:20:15,965 --> 00:20:20,645
What is wrong with me?
I should stop crying.

217
00:20:20,645 --> 00:20:24,517
I can't see your face
with tears in my eyes, can I?

218
00:20:28,715 --> 00:20:30,657
Did you miss me a lot?

219
00:20:33,149 --> 00:20:36,000
How much did you miss me?

220
00:20:36,717 --> 00:20:38,400
You didn't forget me, did you?

221
00:20:40,501 --> 00:20:41,583
I...

222
00:20:42,764 --> 00:20:47,447
I was sick because I missed you so much.

223
00:20:48,854 --> 00:20:52,662
I was very sick
because I miss you so much.

224
00:20:52,662 --> 00:20:55,377
I couldn't come back because I was sick.

225
00:20:56,628 --> 00:20:57,952
Eun Seo.

226
00:20:59,028 --> 00:21:00,216
Eun Seo.

227
00:21:02,468 --> 00:21:04,164
My Eun Seo.

228
00:21:05,368 --> 00:21:06,565
Eun Seo.

229
00:21:14,121 --> 00:21:15,612
She grew up so well.

230
00:21:17,648 --> 00:21:21,393
She is beautiful. Gorgeous.

231
00:21:23,592 --> 00:21:24,611
Yes.

232
00:21:28,599 --> 00:21:31,370
So, does she work at a hotel?

233
00:21:34,176 --> 00:21:35,316
Yes, Dad.

234
00:21:36,696 --> 00:21:38,411
She raised her well.

235
00:21:41,151 --> 00:21:45,891
She did raise her better
than I ever expected.

236
00:21:52,456 --> 00:21:55,546
It was my mistake.

237
00:21:57,184 --> 00:21:58,907
I made a big mistake.

238
00:22:01,841 --> 00:22:05,866
We should've taken care of Eun Seo,
no matter what.

239
00:22:11,464 --> 00:22:13,638
When your mom was too sick to travel,

240
00:22:15,756 --> 00:22:19,661
I should've come to take her to the U.S.

241
00:22:20,890 --> 00:22:21,980
Dad,

242
00:22:23,561 --> 00:22:24,837
It's fine.

243
00:22:28,123 --> 00:22:29,932
She grew up well.

244
00:22:33,066 --> 00:22:34,957
Eun Seo grew up really well.

245
00:22:38,721 --> 00:22:41,260
You are right.

246
00:22:44,554 --> 00:22:45,789
She grew up so well.

247
00:22:47,705 --> 00:22:48,990
I'm grateful.

248
00:22:50,580 --> 00:22:52,229
Thank her so much for that.

249
00:23:11,818 --> 00:23:12,901
Mom?

250
00:23:13,849 --> 00:23:14,972
Mom.

251
00:23:15,978 --> 00:23:19,032
- Dad.
- Yes.

252
00:23:19,032 --> 00:23:22,328
You could've called me,
I would have gone to Seoul to pick you up.

253
00:23:22,328 --> 00:23:24,831
All the way to Seoul from here?
It wasn't necessary.

254
00:23:24,831 --> 00:23:25,951
Sin Ae.

255
00:23:25,951 --> 00:23:27,145
Mom.

256
00:23:28,735 --> 00:23:29,735
Yes.

257
00:23:30,942 --> 00:23:32,566
What is all that in the garden?

258
00:23:32,566 --> 00:23:36,535
We thought of having lunch together
since it's been a long time.

259
00:23:36,535 --> 00:23:39,534
For real? That's great.

260
00:23:39,534 --> 00:23:41,465
It's perfect because I'm so hungry.

261
00:23:43,832 --> 00:23:45,330
What is wrong, Mom?

262
00:23:47,198 --> 00:23:49,143
- You.
- Yes?

263
00:23:49,725 --> 00:23:53,456
Why didn't you tell us you met Eun Seo?

264
00:23:59,762 --> 00:24:00,998
We are home.

265
00:24:14,642 --> 00:24:17,663
Didn't it take too long, Eun Seo?

266
00:24:25,683 --> 00:24:26,718
Sin Ae.

267
00:24:31,002 --> 00:24:35,420
You two also haven't met each other
for a long time, have you?

268
00:24:49,291 --> 00:24:50,843
Sin Ae, hear me out.

269
00:24:50,843 --> 00:24:52,659
- Sin Ae.
- Sin Ae.

270
00:24:54,472 --> 00:24:55,699
Yoon Sin Ae.

271
00:25:15,681 --> 00:25:17,459
You are all here.

272
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:19,911
I heard you are having a family gathering.

273
00:25:19,911 --> 00:25:21,443
I guess I deserve to join it now.

274
00:25:28,832 --> 00:25:29,835
What is it?

275
00:25:31,696 --> 00:25:33,060
Did someone hit her?

276
00:25:34,280 --> 00:25:36,828
Who hit her?

277
00:26:03,290 --> 00:26:07,617
So, this makes 29 votes for Yoon Eun Seo
and 16 votes for Choi Sin Ae.

278
00:26:07,617 --> 00:26:11,676
Our class president
for the second semester is Yoon Eun Seo.

279
00:26:23,785 --> 00:26:25,348
Do not touch Eun Seo's clothes.

280
00:26:25,914 --> 00:26:29,677
Eun Seo!

281
00:26:38,968 --> 00:26:40,090
Bye.

282
00:26:43,557 --> 00:26:44,951
Come here.

283
00:26:44,951 --> 00:26:46,013
What are you doing?

284
00:26:47,563 --> 00:26:49,290
Why do you always behave like this?

285
00:26:50,528 --> 00:26:51,712
What did you touch?

286
00:26:51,712 --> 00:26:53,368
What a temper you have.

287
00:26:53,368 --> 00:26:54,944
What did you just touch?

288
00:26:54,944 --> 00:26:56,893
What did you put your hand on?

289
00:27:21,289 --> 00:27:23,994
Stop there.

290
00:27:26,393 --> 00:27:29,003
I am sorry. I am...

291
00:27:34,070 --> 00:27:35,226
Sin Ae.

292
00:27:39,079 --> 00:27:40,188
Sin Ae.

293
00:27:44,223 --> 00:27:45,409
Sin Ae.

294
00:27:54,774 --> 00:27:55,962
Stop it.

295
00:28:00,271 --> 00:28:01,610
No, I'm not crying.

296
00:28:04,303 --> 00:28:05,874
I'm not.

297
00:28:07,750 --> 00:28:08,843
I'm not crying.

298
00:28:09,974 --> 00:28:11,377
Please stop crying.

299
00:28:18,198 --> 00:28:19,410
Have they treated you well?

300
00:28:21,726 --> 00:28:23,777
Haven't they scolded you too much?

301
00:28:26,311 --> 00:28:27,642
Have they been good to you?

302
00:28:31,776 --> 00:28:32,921
They have treated me well.

303
00:28:34,550 --> 00:28:36,321
Of course, they have. I am their daughter.

304
00:28:38,111 --> 00:28:41,931
I had everything I ever wanted.

305
00:28:45,342 --> 00:28:46,481
Thank you.

306
00:28:48,055 --> 00:28:49,840
I'm so grateful.

307
00:28:51,909 --> 00:28:53,113
Thanks.

308
00:28:59,670 --> 00:29:02,705
That's enough. It's so upsetting.

309
00:29:08,669 --> 00:29:10,098
Why are we like this?

310
00:29:11,224 --> 00:29:13,283
Why are we like this?

311
00:29:15,847 --> 00:29:18,761
Eun Seo is happy to meet her mother,

312
00:29:19,854 --> 00:29:21,353
but why are we like this?

313
00:29:25,190 --> 00:29:26,473
Eun Seo...

314
00:29:28,967 --> 00:29:30,515
Did Eun Seo meet her mom?

315
00:29:33,229 --> 00:29:34,834
Did she?

316
00:29:43,407 --> 00:29:45,424
- I'll get mom here.
- Yes.

317
00:30:06,454 --> 00:30:08,024
Everyone is waiting for you.

318
00:30:10,926 --> 00:30:12,017
What about Sin Ae?

319
00:30:21,127 --> 00:30:22,618
Why did you do that?

320
00:30:23,174 --> 00:30:24,912
It hurts Sin Ae.

321
00:30:27,846 --> 00:30:33,566
Whether I raised Sin Ae well or not,

322
00:30:33,566 --> 00:30:35,281
I had her with me.

323
00:30:37,967 --> 00:30:41,608
I have taken care of her,

324
00:30:43,877 --> 00:30:48,601
although I couldn't do my best
because I was sick.

325
00:30:50,126 --> 00:30:52,289
I have raised her.

326
00:30:54,824 --> 00:30:56,369
But Eun Seo...

327
00:31:00,415 --> 00:31:01,472
Jun Seo.

328
00:31:03,808 --> 00:31:05,689
You love Eun Seo, don't you?

329
00:31:08,605 --> 00:31:13,888
Do you care for her as you did before?

330
00:31:26,135 --> 00:31:27,521
I do.

331
00:31:30,213 --> 00:31:35,841
When she was born, we named her Eun Seo.

332
00:31:38,286 --> 00:31:42,991
And we were happy to imagine
that people would think...

333
00:31:42,991 --> 00:31:46,391
you were loving siblings
when they found out your names...

334
00:31:46,391 --> 00:31:47,752
were Jun Seo and Eun Seo.

335
00:31:49,918 --> 00:31:54,361
Just like your names,
I was picturing that...

336
00:31:55,601 --> 00:31:59,822
you live happily with me forever.

337
00:31:59,822 --> 00:32:01,744
You have no idea how happy I was.

338
00:32:05,079 --> 00:32:06,232
Jun Seo.

339
00:32:07,944 --> 00:32:11,416
You can't leave Eun Seo alone.

340
00:32:12,624 --> 00:32:15,488
You need to care for her...

341
00:32:15,488 --> 00:32:20,972
and take care of her forever
as your sister.

342
00:32:22,225 --> 00:32:23,539
Will you, Jun Seo?

343
00:32:28,288 --> 00:32:29,651
Please answer me.

344
00:32:31,377 --> 00:32:33,348
Promise me.

345
00:32:37,369 --> 00:32:38,459
Yes.

346
00:32:54,284 --> 00:32:57,253
Eun Seo, help yourself.

347
00:32:57,253 --> 00:33:00,131
I made only your favorites.

348
00:33:00,131 --> 00:33:02,156
Is that true?

349
00:33:02,156 --> 00:33:03,996
Then, I will eat them all.

350
00:33:03,996 --> 00:33:06,655
Are you guys that serious already?

351
00:33:08,773 --> 00:33:12,229
I would like to ask your daughter
to marry me.

352
00:33:12,229 --> 00:33:13,575
I will make her happy.

353
00:33:18,972 --> 00:33:20,823
Have you already grown up that much?

354
00:33:21,420 --> 00:33:24,248
But, Jun Seo and Yu Mi
have to get married first.

355
00:33:27,572 --> 00:33:30,295
I have a camera.
Would you like to take some pictures?

356
00:33:30,725 --> 00:33:31,791
Smile.

357
00:33:33,580 --> 00:33:34,825
Get ready now.

358
00:33:35,549 --> 00:33:36,625
One.

359
00:33:44,565 --> 00:33:49,118
You and Yu Mi look great together.

360
00:33:51,773 --> 00:33:56,287
So I want to be happy like you are.

361
00:33:57,516 --> 00:33:59,655
Do you really love Tae Seok?

362
00:34:01,348 --> 00:34:02,928
You don't, Eun Seo.

363
00:34:04,469 --> 00:34:06,205
When she was born,

364
00:34:07,473 --> 00:34:10,924
we named her Eun Seo. And we were happy...

365
00:34:13,217 --> 00:34:17,122
to imagine that people would think
you were loving siblings...

366
00:34:17,122 --> 00:34:21,644
when they found out
your names were Jun Seo and Eun Seo.

367
00:34:23,392 --> 00:34:24,532
Jun Seo.

368
00:34:26,266 --> 00:34:28,452
You can't leave Eun Seo alone.

369
00:34:29,666 --> 00:34:31,293
You need to care for her...

370
00:34:32,482 --> 00:34:38,194
and take care of her forever
as your sister.

371
00:34:38,194 --> 00:34:39,462
Will you, Jun Seo?

372
00:34:41,792 --> 00:34:45,427
Yes, I admit you're pretty.
I didn't say otherwise. Yu Mi.

373
00:34:45,976 --> 00:34:47,448
Mister.

374
00:34:47,448 --> 00:34:51,104
You call me "mister."
That's why I said you're not pretty.

375
00:34:51,104 --> 00:34:53,947
All right, you win. Ji Hwan.

376
00:34:53,947 --> 00:34:55,877
Okay, so pretty.

377
00:34:55,877 --> 00:34:57,374
Yu Mi is pretty.

378
00:34:57,374 --> 00:34:59,957
You, mister.

379
00:34:59,957 --> 00:35:01,932
You called me mister, again.

380
00:35:01,932 --> 00:35:03,247
What is so funny?

381
00:35:04,461 --> 00:35:05,689
Jun Seo.

382
00:35:05,689 --> 00:35:08,448
One is Jun Seo, and the other is mister.

383
00:35:08,448 --> 00:35:10,099
All right, whatever.

384
00:35:13,991 --> 00:35:17,920
Mom and Dad haven't changed at all.

385
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:18,978
Right?

386
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:22,098
You haven't changed, either.

387
00:35:23,160 --> 00:35:25,625
Look at this grumpy face.

388
00:35:25,625 --> 00:35:26,625
What did you say?

389
00:35:39,617 --> 00:35:40,964
I've been thinking about...

390
00:35:44,224 --> 00:35:47,403
what I would have been left with
if I hadn't had you.

391
00:35:52,159 --> 00:35:53,987
I believe I would have nothing left.

392
00:35:59,536 --> 00:36:00,820
I would, too.

393
00:36:02,808 --> 00:36:04,060
Me too, Jun Seo.

394
00:36:05,449 --> 00:36:06,449
Eun Seo.

395
00:36:10,057 --> 00:36:12,036
Because of you, my life became...

396
00:36:14,944 --> 00:36:18,068
so beautiful that it is incomparable.

397
00:36:20,226 --> 00:36:21,237
Yes.

398
00:36:24,987 --> 00:36:27,084
Let's stay together
for the rest of our lives.

399
00:36:35,610 --> 00:36:36,885
As brother and sister.

400
00:36:45,099 --> 00:36:49,765
Then, without betraying or hurting anyone,

401
00:36:50,905 --> 00:36:52,662
we can be together forever.

402
00:36:56,137 --> 00:36:57,525
For the rest of our lives.

403
00:37:16,348 --> 00:37:18,774
Yoon Jun Seo, what brought you here?

404
00:37:20,251 --> 00:37:22,601
Do you want to grab a drink?

405
00:37:27,763 --> 00:37:30,358
What is happening? You can drink.

406
00:37:31,780 --> 00:37:32,927
I'm sorry.

407
00:37:34,507 --> 00:37:35,534
For what?

408
00:37:38,972 --> 00:37:41,462
I'm sorry for having
such a beautiful cousin.

409
00:37:48,420 --> 00:37:52,335
You like Eun Seo a lot, don't you?

410
00:37:54,091 --> 00:37:55,339
Yes, I do.

411
00:37:55,339 --> 00:37:56,339
Okay.

412
00:37:58,729 --> 00:38:01,805
Are you worried?
What are you concerned about?

413
00:38:03,209 --> 00:38:04,475
I'm not.

414
00:38:06,017 --> 00:38:07,083
I just...

415
00:38:13,681 --> 00:38:18,209
I wonder if you know how beautiful
Eun Seo is.

416
00:38:19,704 --> 00:38:21,315
You should know that in full.

417
00:38:22,678 --> 00:38:25,932
- I shouldn't know everything about her.
- What?

418
00:38:25,932 --> 00:38:27,693
I'll take my time to get to know her,
so don't worry.

419
00:38:27,693 --> 00:38:28,887
We have lots of time.

420
00:38:30,380 --> 00:38:33,871
Yes, you have time.

421
00:38:37,219 --> 00:38:39,021
But can I tell you something?

422
00:38:48,429 --> 00:38:50,505
When Eun Seo gets upset,
she always laughs.

423
00:38:50,505 --> 00:38:51,908
Right, you are right.

424
00:38:51,908 --> 00:38:54,403
She laughs when she is upset,
which is scary.

425
00:38:54,826 --> 00:39:00,293
When she sleeps,
she falls asleep against the wall.

426
00:39:01,026 --> 00:39:02,100
Is that so?

427
00:39:04,178 --> 00:39:05,244
And...

428
00:39:06,908 --> 00:39:08,294
she says, "you are mean,"

429
00:39:10,002 --> 00:39:12,668
and "thanks for the meal" while dining.

430
00:39:16,818 --> 00:39:19,076
She has always had long hair,
since she was little.

431
00:39:20,017 --> 00:39:22,011
She used to like making confessions.

432
00:39:30,673 --> 00:39:34,778
She was so bad at sports.

433
00:39:34,778 --> 00:39:37,066
Also, she whined a lot.

434
00:39:37,066 --> 00:39:38,350
She was such a whiner.

435
00:39:49,090 --> 00:39:50,667
I'm sorry.

436
00:39:58,801 --> 00:40:00,585
Are you drunk?

437
00:40:00,585 --> 00:40:01,788
You are drunk.

438
00:40:03,624 --> 00:40:06,750
I can't believe Yoon Jun Seo got drunk.

439
00:40:42,662 --> 00:40:43,698
One more thing.

440
00:40:44,384 --> 00:40:46,073
It's the most important thing.

441
00:40:47,544 --> 00:40:49,465
When Eun Seo plays Rock, Paper, Scissors,

442
00:40:50,743 --> 00:40:54,378
she always makes a Rock, Tae Seok.

443
00:40:54,935 --> 00:40:55,935
Really?

444
00:41:29,087 --> 00:41:30,441
Rock, Paper, Scissors.

445
00:41:33,319 --> 00:41:34,577
Rock, Paper, Scissors.

446
00:41:37,567 --> 00:41:39,225
Rock, Paper, Scissors.

447
00:41:40,306 --> 00:41:42,357
Why do I always make a Rock?

448
00:41:43,418 --> 00:41:46,032
- Rock, Paper, Scissors.
- Wait.

449
00:41:52,669 --> 00:41:56,128
I was overjoyed when you called.

450
00:41:57,813 --> 00:42:02,553
I thought I was the only one
who called now.

451
00:42:04,750 --> 00:42:05,824
Yu Mi.

452
00:42:10,782 --> 00:42:11,937
I'm sorry.

453
00:42:12,589 --> 00:42:14,591
What is wrong?

454
00:42:15,117 --> 00:42:16,117
No, nothing.

455
00:42:18,289 --> 00:42:20,341
I'll call you more often.

456
00:42:22,936 --> 00:42:24,325
I'll call you before you do.

457
00:42:26,109 --> 00:42:30,457
Jun Seo, have you made up your mind?

458
00:42:30,457 --> 00:42:33,372
Did you decide to stay with me?

459
00:42:39,257 --> 00:42:41,107
I'm sorry for hurting you.

460
00:42:43,041 --> 00:42:44,180
I'm sorry.

461
00:42:46,409 --> 00:42:48,204
I'm also sorry that...

462
00:42:49,986 --> 00:42:52,722
all I can say is that
I'll continue to try harder.

463
00:42:54,505 --> 00:42:56,068
If you would still like that...

464
00:42:57,162 --> 00:43:00,973
I would like that, yes. I like it.

465
00:43:00,973 --> 00:43:02,384
I like it, Jun Seo.

466
00:43:14,805 --> 00:43:19,076
Eun Seo, would you like to stay with me?

467
00:43:19,076 --> 00:43:20,198
What?

468
00:43:21,312 --> 00:43:23,503
Ji Hwan said that...

469
00:43:23,503 --> 00:43:27,957
the studio doesn't have enough space
since he expanded the work area.

470
00:43:27,957 --> 00:43:29,818
Didn't Jun Seo tell you about it?

471
00:43:30,551 --> 00:43:31,879
I see...

472
00:43:31,879 --> 00:43:35,766
If you have nowhere to go,
you can stay in my apartment.

473
00:43:35,766 --> 00:43:38,001
You should. Will you do that?

474
00:43:38,815 --> 00:43:41,736
No, I think I'm all right.

475
00:43:41,736 --> 00:43:43,888
I can go back to the staff accommodations.

476
00:43:44,302 --> 00:43:45,825
To the staff accommodations?

477
00:43:45,825 --> 00:43:48,077
To the staff accommodations? Really?

478
00:43:48,823 --> 00:43:51,146
Then we can see each other
morning and night.

479
00:43:51,905 --> 00:43:53,175
Tae Seok.

480
00:43:53,175 --> 00:43:56,567
That's great.
It's a bit dangerous at night here.

481
00:43:56,567 --> 00:43:59,159
I have also been worried
since this place isn't that comfortable.

482
00:43:59,159 --> 00:44:01,415
Your brother's not much of a help.

483
00:44:01,415 --> 00:44:02,630
Are you saying she's been a burden?

484
00:44:02,630 --> 00:44:04,942
It would be great to leave
before you annoy him.

485
00:44:04,942 --> 00:44:07,176
Yes, it's great.

486
00:44:08,311 --> 00:44:09,625
Do you want to submit the application?

487
00:44:10,423 --> 00:44:12,558
- Don't do that.
- Really?

488
00:44:15,701 --> 00:44:17,581
Then, let's play Rock, Paper, Scissors.

489
00:44:17,581 --> 00:44:18,776
No.

490
00:44:32,703 --> 00:44:34,336
The staff accommodations, please.

491
00:44:35,301 --> 00:44:36,701
What?

492
00:44:36,701 --> 00:44:39,494
What do you mean my application
to the staff accommodations got canceled?

493
00:44:39,494 --> 00:44:41,150
Don't you know that?

494
00:44:41,150 --> 00:44:43,358
I received the list today.

495
00:44:43,358 --> 00:44:45,125
I wonder if it's been decided
on short notice.

496
00:44:45,125 --> 00:44:48,383
No, I had no idea.

497
00:44:48,383 --> 00:44:51,768
I brought all my belongings today.

498
00:44:51,768 --> 00:44:54,503
I need to get into staff accommodations.

499
00:44:54,503 --> 00:44:55,826
I have nowhere to go.

500
00:44:57,046 --> 00:44:59,934
If you are really desperate,

501
00:44:59,934 --> 00:45:02,990
why don't you ask Director Han?

502
00:45:02,990 --> 00:45:05,983
Don't get me wrong.
I'm saying it with good intention.

503
00:45:07,017 --> 00:45:11,136
I'm sorry I was mistaken about you
and gave you a hard time.

504
00:45:12,293 --> 00:45:16,725
Actually,
Director Han came to me the other day,

505
00:45:16,725 --> 00:45:19,039
he told me he's getting married to you.

506
00:45:20,228 --> 00:45:23,053
I think it would be best...

507
00:45:23,053 --> 00:45:25,207
to ask Director Han.

508
00:45:31,080 --> 00:45:33,948
Don't you believe me?

509
00:45:33,948 --> 00:45:36,411
I really came to my senses.

510
00:45:36,411 --> 00:45:39,422
Has Han Tae Seok finally settled?

511
00:45:39,422 --> 00:45:43,838
I'll introduce you to her soon.
You have no idea how beautiful she is.

512
00:45:43,838 --> 00:45:46,882
Quit just talking about it and set a date.

513
00:45:59,327 --> 00:46:00,352
Mom.

514
00:46:04,039 --> 00:46:05,978
What are you doing, mom?

515
00:46:08,744 --> 00:46:10,226
Take this with you.

516
00:46:10,799 --> 00:46:11,881
Mom?

517
00:46:13,361 --> 00:46:15,808
I heard they came back to Korea.

518
00:46:17,203 --> 00:46:19,215
If you stay with me,

519
00:46:19,215 --> 00:46:21,930
you would end up living like me.

520
00:46:24,021 --> 00:46:28,642
I'll pretend you got married and left.

521
00:46:29,944 --> 00:46:32,702
I know they couldn't forget you,

522
00:46:32,702 --> 00:46:34,917
and she has been sick.

523
00:46:36,295 --> 00:46:39,271
It is an emotional journey
to raise someone.

524
00:46:39,271 --> 00:46:40,881
So, go to them.

525
00:46:41,478 --> 00:46:42,941
Mom, I'm sorry.

526
00:46:42,941 --> 00:46:44,694
If you don't like it,
I won't meet them again.

527
00:46:44,694 --> 00:46:46,738
I'm sorry, Mom.

528
00:46:48,231 --> 00:46:49,736
Leave.

529
00:46:49,736 --> 00:46:51,686
I did enough for you until now,
when I had nothing.

530
00:46:51,686 --> 00:46:54,472
Why do you want to stay,
when I say you bother me?

531
00:46:54,472 --> 00:46:57,295
My life would be much better
if it weren't for you.

532
00:46:57,295 --> 00:46:59,169
I took and raised you so far
because you are my child.

533
00:46:59,169 --> 00:47:01,062
But it's time for you to leave.
Live on your own now.

534
00:47:01,062 --> 00:47:02,629
- Mom.
- Go.

535
00:47:02,629 --> 00:47:05,723
Go to your real mom. Go.

536
00:47:05,723 --> 00:47:07,914
- Mom.
- Go to your real mom.

537
00:47:07,914 --> 00:47:09,435
- Mom.
- Go.

538
00:47:09,435 --> 00:47:12,055
- Mom.
- Go.

539
00:47:12,055 --> 00:47:16,047
Mom.

540
00:47:16,047 --> 00:47:17,627
Mom.

541
00:47:18,198 --> 00:47:19,447
Mom.

542
00:47:19,447 --> 00:47:20,839
Mom.

543
00:47:22,611 --> 00:47:23,866
Go.

544
00:47:23,866 --> 00:47:25,397
Mom.

545
00:47:54,558 --> 00:47:56,393
You're not my daughter.

546
00:47:59,928 --> 00:48:02,304
You're too much for me from the beginning.

547
00:48:07,381 --> 00:48:10,106
Although it's late, study properly,

548
00:48:13,237 --> 00:48:15,121
wear some nice clothes,

549
00:48:19,079 --> 00:48:22,066
and don't look so grim
at such a young age.

550
00:48:35,824 --> 00:48:36,997
What do you mean?

551
00:48:36,997 --> 00:48:38,840
Why couldn't she get into
the staff accommodations?

552
00:48:38,840 --> 00:48:40,584
Didn't she come to you?

553
00:48:40,584 --> 00:48:44,099
- No, she didn't.
- She didn't?

554
00:48:44,099 --> 00:48:46,267
She said she had nowhere to go.

555
00:48:46,267 --> 00:48:47,870
Where did she go, then?

556
00:49:07,272 --> 00:49:09,959
I think we'll be done by tomorrow
once we move some more.

557
00:49:10,781 --> 00:49:13,116
It would be better for you
to find another studio.

558
00:49:13,116 --> 00:49:15,447
I like it here. I'll work here.

559
00:49:18,349 --> 00:49:20,907
- I'm leaving.
- All right, bye.

560
00:49:38,966 --> 00:49:40,041
Jun Seo.

561
00:49:44,615 --> 00:49:47,545
Eun Seo, what are you doing here?

562
00:49:49,031 --> 00:49:51,602
I brought my stuff from home.

563
00:49:51,602 --> 00:49:53,280
I'm heading to
the staff accommodations now.

564
00:49:54,918 --> 00:49:55,918
I see.

565
00:49:56,561 --> 00:50:00,862
I forgot something,
so I stopped by to pick it up.

566
00:50:00,862 --> 00:50:02,623
Okay, come on in.

567
00:50:08,395 --> 00:50:09,589
It's not here.

568
00:50:10,531 --> 00:50:12,934
It's not. I came for no reason, then.

569
00:50:13,810 --> 00:50:14,810
Is it not there?

570
00:50:20,363 --> 00:50:21,606
I'll come by often.

571
00:50:22,661 --> 00:50:24,700
Can I come often?

572
00:50:24,700 --> 00:50:25,719
Of course.

573
00:50:26,484 --> 00:50:27,526
I will, then.

574
00:50:29,339 --> 00:50:32,868
I was going to leave
when you weren't here,

575
00:50:32,868 --> 00:50:36,360
so I took my stuff when I went to work.
But I failed.

576
00:50:38,859 --> 00:50:42,999
Eun Seo, is something wrong?

577
00:50:45,299 --> 00:50:46,797
No, nothing's wrong.

578
00:50:48,529 --> 00:50:51,185
It's getting late.
The staff accommodations will close soon.

579
00:50:51,185 --> 00:50:52,244
I should get going.

580
00:50:54,896 --> 00:50:55,947
Eun Seo.

581
00:50:57,735 --> 00:50:59,147
Jun Seo.

582
00:51:00,992 --> 00:51:02,778
Be nice to Yu Mi.

583
00:51:05,870 --> 00:51:08,233
I'll be nice to Tae Seok,

584
00:51:09,175 --> 00:51:11,416
and you'll do the same to Yu Mi.

585
00:51:15,975 --> 00:51:17,449
Give it to me. I'll give you a ride.

586
00:51:29,134 --> 00:51:30,134
Jun Seo.

587
00:51:34,984 --> 00:51:36,034
Eun Seo.

588
00:51:36,591 --> 00:51:37,872
Don't turn around.

589
00:51:41,096 --> 00:51:42,121
Jun Seo.

590
00:51:44,638 --> 00:51:49,185
We are brother and sister now, right?

591
00:52:26,783 --> 00:52:27,783
Eun Seo.

592
00:52:33,926 --> 00:52:35,216
When did you know?

593
00:52:35,878 --> 00:52:39,712
Don't you think we are going against fate?

594
00:52:39,712 --> 00:52:41,461
So what? What if we do?

595
00:52:41,461 --> 00:52:42,665
It's my fate, too.

596
00:52:42,665 --> 00:52:45,185
My fate is much more powerful.
I will show them that.

597
00:52:45,185 --> 00:52:46,226
Marry me.

598
00:52:46,919 --> 00:52:48,340
Marry me, Choi Eun Seo.

599
00:52:51,063 --> 00:52:53,467
Eun Seo, is it Jun Seo you like?

600
00:52:54,705 --> 00:52:56,627
Do you have a secret
that you can't say out loud?

601
00:52:56,627 --> 00:52:59,210
- Stop it.
- You don't get to yell at me.

602
00:52:59,210 --> 00:53:00,472
The secret.

603
00:53:02,678 --> 00:53:04,335
Can I tell you what it is?

604
00:53:05,648 --> 00:53:07,641
The secret is that you like Jun Seo.

605
00:53:07,641 --> 00:53:08,709
Han Tae Seok.
